  "idea": "How to auto-caption your phone videos for free using CapCut",
  "text": "Over eighty percent of people watch social media videos with the sound completely turned off. If your clips lack captions, viewers swipe past your content in less than two seconds. Without on-screen text, silent viewers miss your message, ruining your video retention and engagement rates. Open CapCut on your phone, tap Text, choose Auto Captions, and generate animated subtitles automatically. You capture silent scrollers and boost watch time instantly.",
